# recon-agent one-shot / `make demo` run artifact. defaultResolvedPath is
# "recon_resolved.jsonl" (recon-agent/cmd/main.go), written to the CWD (the
# recon-agent/ dir under `make demo`, or the repo root if run there). It is a
# per-run output log, never a committed artifact (the committed eval corpus is
# eval/recon_corpus.jsonl). Ignoring it (in any directory) keeps demo/one-shot
# runs from dirtying the working tree.
recon_resolved.jsonl
# recon-agent coverage profile written by `make test` (Finding #4): a build/run
# output, never source, so it must not pollute the working tree.
recon-agent/coverage.out
